{"id":"wb-4-65","name":"合浦汉墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"合浦汉墓群","text":"合浦汉墓群位于中国广西壮族自治区北海市合浦县环城公社廉南、廉东、冲口、塘排、禁山大队。1981年8月25日公布为第二批广西壮族自治区文物保护单位；1996年11月20日公布为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%88%E6%B5%A6%E6%B1%89%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":93030361,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93030361","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0c6a1120c076037d3735d756.jpg","title":"合浦汉墓群分布图 3763.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%90%88%E6%B5%A6%E6%B1%89%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%9B%BE_3763.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fc/%E5%90%88%E6%B5%A6%E6%B1%89%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4%E5%88%86%E5%B8%83%E5%9B%BE_3763.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​合浦汉墓群分布图","width":320,"height":400,"matchEvidence":"维基共享资源名称与所在地一致"}}